{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"中環海濱直擊｜美酒佳餚巡禮最後衝刺　丁財兩旺　參展商指生意額多兩成\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-1900-LIVE-WINE-261101.png\"><p>【Now新聞台】本台記者劉曼姿晚上7時許在中環海濱報道指，今日是美酒佳餚巡禮最後一天，入夜後人流越見增多，不少市民把握機會入場品嚐美酒佳餚。有參展商表示，連日受惠於萬聖節帶動下，人流及生意較預期高出一至兩成，可謂丁財兩旺。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.577768+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T11:42:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:18:12.810078+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:05.209271+00:00","content_hash":"93fbd1254231683e7225b100ad50e8e439417fc3f3f30870187faa684c5d46a8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.577768+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}